IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ks-types`
IMPORT `ks-membership`
IMPORT `ks-contributions`
IMPORT `ks-withdrawals`
IMPORT `ks-goal`

-- KiwiSaver Act 2006 — TESTS.
-- Expected values are worked from
-- ../registers/source-bundle/act_public_2006_40.txt, not from the code.
-- Amounts are made up; the qualification age (65) is an input.

§ `Tests`

§§ `Helpers`

GIVEN born IS A DATE
GIVETH A Person
`a resident born` born MEANS Person OF born, 65, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE

`an adult` MEANS `a resident born` (Date 1 1 1990)

GIVEN started IS A DATE, k IS A `Kind of employment`
GIVETH AN Employment
`employment from` started k MEANS Employment OF started, k, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE

`new job` MEANS `employment from` (Date 1 3 2025) `ordinary employment`

-- Pay: history, chosen rate, rate reduction, suspended, date, gross.
GIVEN gross IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE, chosen IS A MAYBE NUMBER, reduction IS A BOOLEAN, suspended IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Contribution facts`
`pay of` gross `on` d `, chosen` chosen `, reduction:` reduction `, suspended:` suspended MEANS
    `Contribution facts` OF `deductions first applied on or after 1 April 2009`, chosen, reduction, suspended, d, gross

`a 1000 pay` MEANS `pay of` 1000 `on` (Date 1 6 2025) `, chosen` NOTHING `, reduction:` FALSE `, suspended:` FALSE

-- Employer side: age, lock-in, 12B, defined benefit, deductions, 3% choice, other, hybrid, grace.
GIVEN other IS A NUMBER, applies3 IS A BOOLEAN, grace IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `Employer contribution facts`
`employer side` other applies3 grace MEANS
    `Employer contribution facts` OF 30, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, applies3, other, 0, grace

`the account` MEANS `Member account` OF 50000, 5000, 4000, 2000

-- Withdrawal: purpose; age; qualification age reached; retired; first home
-- facts (made before, years, residence, never held); satisfied; exhausted;
-- needed; emigrated; applied; liability.
GIVEN p IS A `Withdrawal purpose`, age IS A NUMBER, satisfied IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Withdrawal facts`
`withdrawal for` p `aged` age `, satisfied:` satisfied MEANS
    `Withdrawal facts` OF p, age, age AT LEAST 65, TRUE, FALSE, 4, TRUE, TRUE, satisfied, TRUE, NOTHING, Date 1 3 2024, Date 1 3 2025, 3000

