§§ `The top-level goal`

#ASSERT (`the KiwiSaver position for` (`KiwiSaver case` OF `an adult`, `new job`, `a 1000 pay`, `employer side` 0 FALSE FALSE, NOTHING, `the account`))'s `automatic enrolment applies` EQUALS TRUE
